./docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/code-codex-r2.log:4709:docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r7-delta.log:6815:  1047	docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r1.log:9053:[高] [GRILL.md:27](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/GRILL.md:27) 证据：E1–E6 尚未钉住上述风险。E1 未定义“未知键拒”是毒化整批还是静默丢事件；E2 只写一个 issuer throw，未覆盖 source/resolved/distilled；E3 未覆盖 observer begin/finish 与 formal/prepared 拒付；E5 在 [plan.md:20](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan.md:20) 被弱化为返回对象深等，未证明输出字节、调用次数、ratchet、关闭次数、控制台及缺省不落边车；E6 未约束异步 sink 或每个发射点；[plan.md:27](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan.md:27) 的 A1–A3 也未定义。修法：采用 append-or-poison collector；为所有拒付点建立枚举矩阵；E5 比较返回值、产物字节、调用/关闭次数及无边车副作用；E6 遍历每个发射点，并将 sink 明确定义为同步接口；补齐 A1–A3 的输入、预期退出码及产物断言。
